      "kind": "text",
      "name": "If someone changes a file while you are editing, read the…",
      "text": "If someone changes a file while you are editing, read the newer version before submitting a replacement. Approval is tied to the exact candidate and its base version.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
